# condor_submit_dag uninformed_decade_dsat.dag : uninformed_decade.dag trained again with the decay rate of the regions
# constant above A_SAT = 100 MSH (the large regions lived too short), on the SDO masks of uninformed_decade.dag
# (${BASE}/uninformed_decade/maps, not computed again); everything in ${BASE}/uninformed_decade_dsat
# (settings_uninformed_dsat.sh):
#   1. the training (uninformed_train_dsat.sub)
#   2. 3 months of synthetic masks at the solar minimum and maximum, compared with SDO (uninformed_synth_dsat.sub)
JOB train  uninformed_train_dsat.sub
JOB synth  uninformed_synth_dsat.sub
PARENT train CHILD synth
